Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:44:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] MiuiCamera: Let the encoder output Annex-B streams

The app asks Qualcomm's encoder for length-prefixed NAL units, which
only Qualcomm's MPEG4Writer understands. AOSP's can't find the codec
configuration in them and writes video tracks without a sample
description. Keep the default Annex-B output, the writer adds the
length prefixes itself.
---
 smali_classes4/Jb/g.smali | 32 --------------------------------
 1 file changed, 32 deletions(-)

